{"sha": "d32d3bb47ebb4e3d48e31c3c6cd468d4aa1b338960a210d02061adda47d58f8b", "body": ["{\\small 一座被雨水风化的石灰岩雕像：一个", "历时数世纪的反应。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{消耗速率与生成速率}", "", "\\begin{definition}[消耗速率、生成速率]\\label{def:g12:reaction-rates:rate}", "在体积恒定的溶液中，反应物 A 的\\emph{消耗速率}\\index{消耗速率}", "在时刻 $t$ 时为", "\\[", "  v_A(t) = -\\frac{d[\\ce{A}]}{dt},", "\\]", "而生成物 P 的\\emph{生成速率}\\index{生成速率}", "为 $v_P(t) = \\dfrac{d[\\ce{P}]}{dt}$，二者均为正，单位为", "\\si{mol.L^{-1}.min^{-1}}（或每秒）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "", "\\begin{method}[由切线读取速率]\\label{met:g12:reaction-rates:tangent}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 在 $[\\ce{A}]$ 关于 $t$ 的曲线上，作", "        所选时刻的切线。", "  \\item 在切线上取相距较远的两点，计算其斜率，", "        即 $\\Delta[\\ce{A}] / \\Delta t$。", "  \\item 消耗速率等于该斜率的相反数（对于", "        生成物，则为斜率本身）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.8\\linewidth, height=6.4cm, xmin=0, xmax=60, ymin=0,", "    ymax=11, xlabel={$t$ (\\si{min})}, ylabel={$[\\ce{A}]$ (\\si{mmol/L})},", "    axis lines*=left, ymajorgrids, xmajorgrids, grid style={gray!20},", "    tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small},", "    legend style={font=\\small, at={(0.98,0.97)}, anchor=north east,", "    draw=none, fill=white}, legend cell align=left]", "  \\addplot[very thick, omDef] table[x=t, y=A1] {figdata/out/grade-12-reaction-rates-a.dat};", "  \\addplot[very thick, omThm] table[x=t, y=A2] {figdata/out/grade-12-reaction-rates-a.dat};", "  \\addplot[thick, dashed, omProp, restrict y to domain=0:11] table[x=t, y=tangent]", "    {figdata/out/grade-12-reaction-rates-a.dat};", "  \\legend{$k = \\qty{0.050}{min^{-1}}$, $k = \\qty{0.100}{min^{-1}}$（温度较高），", "    $t = 0$ 处的切线}", "  \\addplot[densely dotted, black!60] coordinates {(0,5) (13.86,5) (13.86,0)};", "  \\addplot[densely dotted, black!60] coordinates {(6.93,5) (6.93,0)};", "  \\node[font=\\small, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:14.6,5.4) {$t_{1/2} = \\qty{13.9}{min}$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, anchor=south east] at (axis cs:6.7,0.2) {\\qty{6.9}{min}};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 同一一级反应在两种温度下，反应物 A 的浓度随时间的变化。", "$t = 0$ 处的切线（虚线）给出初始速率；", "点线标出半衰期。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[初始速率]\\label{ex:g12:reaction-rates:initial}", "在蓝色曲线上，$t = 0$ 处的切线", "自 $t = 0$ 时的 \\qty{10.0}{mmol/L} 降为 $0$（$t = \\qty{20}{min}$ 时），其斜率为", "$-10.0/20 = \\qty{-0.50}{mmol.L^{-1}.min^{-1}}$，故初始消耗速率为", "\\qty{0.50}{mmol.L^{-1}.min^{-1}}。随后曲线趋于平缓，", "速率下降：反应随着 A 的消耗而变慢。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{一级反应}", "", "\\begin{definition}[一级反应、速率常数]\\label{def:g12:reaction-rates:first-order}", "若某反应对 A 为\\emph{一级反应}\\index{一级反应}，", "即 A 的消耗速率", "在每一时刻都与 A 的浓度成正比：", "\\[", "  -\\frac{d[\\ce{A}]}{dt} = k\\,[\\ce{A}] .", "\\]", "正常数 $k$，单位为 \\si{min^{-1}} 或 \\si{s^{-1}}，是", "\\emph{速率常数}\\index{速率常数}；它依赖于温度。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[指数衰减]\\label{prop:g12:reaction-rates:exponential}", "对于初始浓度为 $[\\ce{A}]_0$ 的一级反应，", "\\[", "  [\\ce{A}](t) = [\\ce{A}]_0\\, e^{-kt} .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "函数 $f(t) = [\\ce{A}]_0 e^{-kt}$ 的导数为", "$f'(t) = -k [\\ce{A}]_0 e^{-kt} = -k f(t)$，故它满足速率方程，", "且 $f(0) = [\\ce{A}]_0$。它是满足此条件的唯一函数，", "这一点在本阶段不加证明地承认（该结论在数学中对 $y' = ay$ 的方程给出证明）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[检验是否为一级反应]\\label{met:g12:reaction-rates:test}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 由测量数据，计算各时刻的 $\\ln [\\ce{A}]$", "        代以 $\\ln A$（吸光度正比于 $[\\ce{A}]$）。", "  \\item 作 $\\ln[\\ce{A}]$ 关于 $t$ 的图像。由于", "        $\\ln[\\ce{A}] = \\ln[\\ce{A}]_0 - kt$，各点落在一条直线上，", "        当且仅当该反应为一级反应。", "  \\item 直线的斜率为 $-k$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{半衰期}", "", "\\begin{definition}[半衰期]\\label{def:g12:reaction-rates:half-life}", "反应的\\emph{半衰期}\\index{半衰期} $t_{1/2}$ 是指", "限量反应物的浓度降至初始值的一半", "所需的时间。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[一级反应的半衰期]\\label{prop:g12:reaction-rates:half-life}", "对于一级反应，", "\\[", "  t_{1/2} = \\frac{\\ln 2}{k},", "\\]", "与初始浓度无关；经过 $n$ 个半衰期后，", "浓度被除以 $2^n$。", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}